.Sh SHELL COMPLETION
The shipped bash, zsh, and fish completions suggest local branch, remote,
and tag names for commands that take them.
Push suggests a remote, then a local branch.
Fetch and pull suggest a remote; they accept no branch argument.
Completion reads local metadata only and stays silent outside a repository.

.Sh S3 CERTIFICATE TRUST
Set
.Ev KIT_SSL_CA_FILE
to a PEM CA bundle to add trust roots for S3 metadata requests and pack uploads.
Certificate-chain and hostname verification remain enabled.
An unreadable, empty, or malformed bundle fails the connection.
S3 does not read the Connect-only
.Cm http.sslCAInfo
configuration key.
